      en: ["Reaches an altitude of approximately 1,100 meters", "Located in the central Sidi Bouzid Governorate", "Part of the central Tunisian Dorsal mountain range", "Topography features deep gorges and dry riverbeds", "Key area for the growth of resilient esparto grass", "Geology consists of sedimentary limestone and marl"],
