      en: ["Reaches a maximum altitude of 988 meters", "Part of the northeastern Tunisian Dorsal range", "Geology consists primarily of Jurassic limestone", "Home to several endemic North Tunisian plant species", "Springs at the base support local olive cultivation", "Popular spot for technical hiking and rock climbing"],
